data: {"id": "85d81e38f1e14915-final", "run_id": "85d81e38f1e14915", "seq": 1267, "ts_ms": 1788416665283, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w 持续处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，无法启动容器 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount 108s (x13 over 12m) kubelet MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 直接指出 Volume \"input\" 因 ConfigMap \"unavailable-config\" 缺失导致挂载失败 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.condition` (ContainersReady=False, reason=ContainersNotReady); `pod.phase` (Pending); `container.waiting_reason` (ContainerCreating) | 确证 Pod 卡在初始化阶段，容器未进入就绪状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `container.resource_request.memory` (8Mi), `container.resource_limit.memory` (32Mi) | 排除容器资源限制导致挂载/启动阻塞的可能性 |\n\n*证据关联：K8s 事件直接引用了不存在的 ConfigMap ID 以及挂载失败的具体动作（FailedMount），与 K8s 状态（Pending/ContainerCreating）形成了从“触发原因”到“当前症状”的完整闭环。由于容器未启动，Metrics/Logging/Tracing 维度无实际业务数据可佐证或补充。*\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 声明挂载 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' → ConfigMap 缺失导致 FailedMount → Volume 挂载超时且未重试成功 → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**Pod 定义的 Volume \"input\" 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap \"unavailable-config\"**。该配置错误导致 kubelet 在初始化容器时持续触发 `FailedMount` 错误，进而使 Pod 处于 `Pending` 且 `ContainerCreating` 状态。这一结论由 Kubernetes 事件日志中的明确报错（证据 #1）与当前的 Pod 状态（证据 #2）直接支撑。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 49.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w: 49.6s (Evidence 42.0s, RCA 7.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 6.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 75.069, "metrics": {"run_id": "85d81e38f1e14915", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 75.06106424331665, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 75061.06424331665, "llm_calls": 18, "llm_duration_ms": 63385.46538352966, "tool_calls": 19, "executed_tool_calls": 17, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 18, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 15602.91314125061, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 11057.847499847412}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18683.24899673462, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 49572.15189933777, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence